{
 "events": [
  {
   "id": "N1",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 0.25,
   "end": 7.334,
   "text": "At 7:25 AM, November 6th, I was watching videos on my phone... when an unknown number texted me."
  },
  {
   "id": "U1",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 7.664,
   "end": 12.004,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     7.664,
     "At midnight, the world ends."
    ],
    [
     9.614,
     "Do exactly what I say, and you'll live."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N2",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 12.354,
   "end": 14.912,
   "text": "I thought it was a prank. Then it texted again."
  },
  {
   "id": "U2",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 15.342,
   "end": 18.252,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     15.342,
     "There's a pizza and a chair in your fridge."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N3",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 19.252,
   "end": 26.892,
   "text": "I checked. There was a pizza... and a chair... inside my fridge. How did it know that? I was home alone."
  },
  {
   "id": "U3",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 28.422,
   "end": 33.942,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     28.422,
     "Don't go to school today."
    ],
    [
     29.982,
     "Buy water, canned food, batteries."
    ],
    [
     32.592,
     "Go. NOW."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "H1",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 34.192,
   "end": 35.422,
   "text": "who is this??"
  },
  {
   "id": "U4",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 35.702,
   "end": 37.592,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     35.702,
     "No time."
    ],
    [
     36.762,
     "Trust me."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N4",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 38.042,
   "end": 44.533,
   "text": "So I went. The store was empty. The cashier kept coughing. And his eyes... were yellow."
  },
  {
   "id": "JS1",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 44.633,
   "end": 46.333
  },
  {
   "id": "U5",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 46.463,
   "end": 51.323,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     46.463,
     "Don't touch him."
    ],
    [
     47.573,
     "Go home."
    ],
    [
     48.533,
     "Lock your door at exactly 11:58."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N5",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 51.773,
   "end": 54.09,
   "text": "11:58. I locked the door."
  },
  {
   "id": "N6",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 54.59,
   "end": 58.85,
   "text": "11:59. Every phone in the city started screaming."
  },
  {
   "id": "N7",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 59.3,
   "end": 61.169,
   "text": "Then the real screaming started."
  },
  {
   "id": "U6",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 62.599,
   "end": 67.359,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     62.599,
     "RULE 1: Don't open the door. For anyone."
    ],
    [
     65.909,
     "Not even people you know."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N8",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 67.909,
   "end": 74.06,
   "text": "Day 3. Someone knocked. It was Mr. Hale, my neighbor. He was begging me to let him in."
  },
  {
   "id": "N9",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 74.56,
   "end": 78.338,
   "text": "My hand was already on the lock... when my phone buzzed."
  },
  {
   "id": "U7",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 78.918,
   "end": 79.488,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     78.918,
     "Don't."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N10",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 80.488,
   "end": 84.114,
   "text": "I didn't open it. 10 seconds later, he stopped begging."
  },
  {
   "id": "JS2",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 84.214,
   "end": 86.414
  },
  {
   "id": "N10b",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 86.514,
   "end": 88.01,
   "text": "And started scratching."
  },
  {
   "id": "U8",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 89.44,
   "end": 93.35,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     89.44,
     "RULE 2: The roof. 3 AM."
    ],
    [
     92.45,
     "Come alone."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N11",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 93.85,
   "end": 100.968,
   "text": "3 AM. Something was buzzing over the city. A drone. It dropped a box, right at my feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "N12",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 101.468,
   "end": 109.742,
   "text": "Inside: a radio, a flashlight, and a map. One place was circled in red. The bridge. Day 30."
  },
  {
   "id": "N13",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 110.642,
   "end": 112.612,
   "text": "Day 12. The power died."
  },
  {
   "id": "U9",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 114.042,
   "end": 117.502,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     114.042,
     "RULE 3: They're drawn to light."
    ],
    [
     116.292,
     "Keep the curtains shut."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N14",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 117.902,
   "end": 123.444,
   "text": "Across the street, someone turned on a flashlight. 30 seconds later... it went out."
  },
  {
   "id": "N15",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 124.344,
   "end": 130.674,
   "text": "Day 18. Trucks. Men in white suits, with a logo I'd never seen before."
  },
  {
   "id": "N16",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 131.124,
   "end": 134.575,
   "text": "They weren't killing the zombies. They were collecting them."
  },
  {
   "id": "N17",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 135.075,
   "end": 138.046,
   "text": "Then one of them looked up. Right at my window."
  },
  {
   "id": "U10",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 138.376,
   "end": 140.036,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     138.376,
     "GET DOWN."
    ],
    [
     139.356,
     "NOW."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N18",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 141.036,
   "end": 143.547,
   "text": "Day 23. I had to ask."
  },
  {
   "id": "H2",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 143.897,
   "end": 145.727,
   "text": "why are you helping me?"
  },
  {
   "id": "U11",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 146.157,
   "end": 147.287,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     146.157,
     "Because I owe you."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "H3",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 147.537,
   "end": 148.647,
   "text": "who ARE you"
  },
  {
   "id": "U12",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 149.277,
   "end": 152.077,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     149.277,
     "You used to be scared of thunder."
    ],
    [
     151.107,
     "You still are."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "JS3",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 152.077,
   "end": 153.677
  },
  {
   "id": "N19",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 153.927,
   "end": 156.791,
   "text": "How did they know that? Nobody knew that."
  },
  {
   "id": "U13",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 157.921,
   "end": 163.181,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     157.921,
     "Tomorrow. 6 AM."
    ],
    [
     160.081,
     "Get to the bridge."
    ],
    [
     160.951,
     "Don't stop. Don't look back."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N20",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 163.581,
   "end": 165.544,
   "text": "My phone was at 1%."
  },
  {
   "id": "N21",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 166.444,
   "end": 172.267,
   "text": "Day 30. I ran. I didn't stop. And they heard every single step."
  },
  {
   "id": "N22",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 172.767,
   "end": 176.473,
   "text": "I made it to the bridge. It was empty. Nobody was there."
  },
  {
   "id": "N23",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 177.073,
   "end": 178.382,
   "text": "Then my phone buzzed."
  },
  {
   "id": "U14",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 179.012,
   "end": 180.502,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     179.012,
     "Turn around."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "JS4",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 180.502,
   "end": 184.702
  },
  {
   "id": "N24",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 184.802,
   "end": 187.792,
   "text": "Behind me... was a man in a white suit."
  },
  {
   "id": "N25",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 189.292,
   "end": 193.351,
   "text": "Who is the unknown number? Comment your guess. Follow for part 2."
  }
 ],
 "story_end": 193.751,
 "total": 196.351
}